[[2,1,0,"<h2>BELT-DRIVEN TIMING SYSTEM</h2><h3>Specifications</h3><h3>Type</h3><p>Driven directly by the toothed belt that also drives the water pump as well as the camshafts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/33762.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><ul class=\"legend\"><li>1 - Drive pulley</li><li>2 - Fixed tensioner</li><li>3 - Exhaust side driven pulley</li><li>4 - Inlet side driven pulley</li><li>5 - Coolant pump</li><li>6 - Moving tensioner</li></ul></figure>"]]